{"id":"ms_print.1","n":"ms_print","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"valgrind","ver":"3.24.0-3.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/v/valgrind-3.24.0-3.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/ms_print.1.gz","sha256":"b6b63b6fd794350a941d10c852285ecc33235f1a9e71f11e21c7b6eb6bea714a","date":"11/01/2024","origin":"Release 3.24.0"},"u":{"pkg":"valgrind","ver":"1:3.18.1-1ubuntu2","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/v/valgrind/valgrind_3.18.1-1ubuntu2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/ms_print.1.gz","sha256":"8376c1524d187246eb09b15531c83d83567bdbc609880622a05bc8126558a221","date":"02/07/2022","origin":"Release 3.18.0"}},"nopt":{"r":5,"u":5},"desc":"post-processing tool for Massif","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>ms_print - post-processing tool for Massif</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>ms_print</b> [<i>options</i>] <i>massif-out-file</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>ms_print</b> takes an output file produced by the Valgrind tool Massif and prints the information in an easy-to-read form.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-h --help </b></dt><dd>Show the help message.</dd></dl> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--version </b></dt><dd>Show the version number.</dd></dl> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--threshold=&lt;m.n&gt; [default: 1.0] </b></dt><dd>Same as Massif's <b>--threshold</b> option, but applied after profiling rather than during.</dd></dl> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--x=&lt;4..1000&gt; [default: 72]</b></dt><dd>Width of the graph, in columns.</dd></dl> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--y=&lt;4..1000&gt; [default: 20] </b></dt><dd>Height of the graph, in rows.</dd></dl>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>valgrind(1), $INSTALL/share/doc/valgrind/html/index.html or http://www.valgrind.org/docs/manual/index.html.</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Nicholas Nethercote.</p>"]]}